{"type":"message","id":"04869ad4","parentId":"165ee239","timestamp":"2026-03-29T23:00:22.611Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to create a concise Korean briefing for Sam based on this data. Let me analyze what I have:\n\nCategory counts:\n- BAU: 1\n- Workplace: 1\n- Security: 3\n- Infrastructure: 4\n\nTotal: 9 items (well under the 25 item limit)\n\nThe script output shows items from 03/29 07:00 to 03/30 07:00, but the current time is Monday, March 30th, 2026 8:00 AM (Asia/Seoul). The data covers 24 hours.\n\nLet me organize by priority:\n\n**Immediate Actions (need attention or cancellation risk):**\n1. Security: Nelson Li's Netskope port URL approval (RITM19549854) - 3rd notice, will auto-cancel\n2. Security: Noah Kim's NotebookLM URL approval - will auto-cancel\n3. Security: Aditya Jossen's Sentinel One USB exception - needs approval by Aug 23\n4. BAU: Power BI Pro license request (RITM19542231) - 3rd notice, will auto-cancel\n5. Workplace: Kang Hyun-woo's PC delivery (RITM19542795) - verbally approved, pending delivery\n\n**Informational/Planning:**\n6. Infrastructure: Azure backup compliance report - all backups successful (Mar 28)\n7. Infrastructure: Azure SQL DB (ONEKORRPADB001DB) at >85% capacity - Sam Yeo requested action\n8. Infrastructure: CRM VM EOL meeting - rescheduled for next week, needs pre-meeting survey\n9. Infrastructure: Sam Yeo's VMs (SCT, RPA) EOL meeting - rescheduled, needs pre-meeting survey\n\nI'll focus on the top priority tasks requiring immediate attention. The critical items are the security and approval requests that could auto-cancel if not addressed promptly. I'll highlight the most urgent action items while keeping the briefing concise and actionable.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"📊 **노션 일일 브리핑 (03/29 07:00 ~ 03/30 07:00)**\n\n카테고리: Security 3, Infrastructure 4, BAU 1, Workplace 1 (총 9건)\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ 즉시 조치 필요\n\n1. **[Security]** Netskope 포트 URL 승인 요청 (RITM19549854) - Nelson Li\n   - 3차 알림: 미조치 시 자동 취소\n\n2. **[Security]** NotebookLM URL 허용 요청 - Noah Kim\n   - 직매장 교육자료 AI 도구: 미조치 시 취소\n\n3. **[Security]** Sentinel One USB 예외 요청 - Aditya Jossen\n   - 법무팀 레거시 문서 접근: 2026-08-23까지 권한 필요\n\n4. **[BAU]** Power BI Pro 라이선스 요청 (RITM19542231)\n   - 물류팀 안전 대시보드: 3차 알림, 미조치 시 취소\n\n5. **[Workplace]** PC 추가 지급 요청 (RITM19542795) - 강현우 주임\n   - 유선 승인 완료, 지급 대기 중\n\n---\n\n## 📋 정보 및 계획\n\n6. **[Infrastructure]** Azure 백업 현황 (03/28)\n   - 전체 일일/주간 백업 성공 완료\n\n7. **[Infrastructure]** Azure SQL 경고\n   - ONEKORRPADB001DB 용량 >85%, Sam Yeo 요청\n\n8. **[Infrastructure]** CRM VM EOL 회의 - 다음 주 재조정\n   - 소유자 VM: 설문지 작성 필요\n\n9. **[Infrastructure]** Sam Yeo 소유 VM(SCT/RPA) EOL 회의 - 다음 주 재조정\n   - 설문지 작성 필요"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":1038,"output":1297,"cacheRead":20369,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22704,"cost":{"input":0.0006228,"output":0.0028534000000000003,"cacheRead":0.00224059,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.005716790000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774825208811,"responseId":"20260330070009aa5b9e2908074fea"}}
